{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18107732","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18107732","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1810773201:0":{"text":"기... 기억이... 돌아왔어...","source_cn":"我……我的记忆……我想起来了……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x908B0533216FE0CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810773202:0":{"text":"에리스, 세인... 미안, 너희를 잊고 있었다니...","source_cn":"爱丝，瑟恩……抱歉，我竟然忘记了你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29C782FCB6A1C614","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810773203:0":{"text":"엉엉... 오빠...","source_cn":"呜呜呜……巴登……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8D80F273FBA27C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810773204:1":{"text":"...기억이 돌아왔다니 다행이야. 기분은 어때?","source_cn":"……想起来就好。感觉如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA4ECE8010F8FC3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810773205:1":{"text":"몸이 내 것이 아닌 것 같아. 너무... 차가워. 심정을 묻는 거라면... 확실히 좀 복잡하네.","source_cn":"身体好像不是自己的，很……冰冷。如果你是指心情……的确...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1EA0C09F169BC86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810773206:1":{"text":"그래도 걱정하지 마. 내가 원래 워낙 낙천적인 사람이라는 거 알잖아? 지금 같은 상황도 받아들이지 못할 건 없어.","source_cn":"不过别担心，你知道的，我向来是个很乐观的家伙。就算是现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EBC10ECC301C2CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810773207:1":{"text":"지금 그 모습으로는 두 번 다시 레오프론 제국과 애쉬 섀도우로 돌아갈 수 없을 거야.","source_cn":"以你现在的模样，恐怕再也无法回到耀光帝国和灰影郡了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AF59D0D75EE717F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810773208:1":{"text":"그렇겠지. 하지만... 이건 내가 할 수 있는 최선의 선택이었어.","source_cn":"是啊，不过……这已经是我力所能及的最好选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB33C94A7E1E750A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810773209:1":{"text":"나 하나를 지키려고 뮤리엘 할멈이 희생했다면, 난 훨씬 무거운 짐을 짊어지고 지금보다 몇 배는 더 고통스러웠을 거야...","source_cn":"如果为了保全我而牺牲穆婆婆，我只会背负起更沉重的负担，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B7C609922B167E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810773210:1":{"text":"그때 나를 막지 않아 줘서 고마워, 세인... 네 마음이 나보다도 훨씬 괴로우리라는 걸 잘 알아.","source_cn":"谢谢你当时没有阻拦我，瑟恩……我知道你心里一定比我更难过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A4DF69D30838B56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810773211:1":{"text":"...내가 널 대신했어야 했는데.","source_cn":"……代替你的人应该是我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C2C59E001F56231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1810773212:1":{"text":"그랬다면 나도 널 구하러 갔을 거야. 과거의 기억이 없었더라도 널 구했을 거라고.","source_cn":"那我也会去救你。即使我没有过去的记忆，也依然会救你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x064B72705A2581EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1810773213:1":{"text":"쯧, 하지만 내가 널 막았을 게야!","source_cn":"哼，但老身会阻拦你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19932D45D12B9351","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1810773214:1":{"text":"하하... 할멈은 저를 막지 못할 걸요.","source_cn":"哈……你可拦不住我，婆婆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF350EE656354F9A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1810773215:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1810773216:0":{"text":"그나저나, 애쉬 섀도우의 상황은 어때? 너랑 에리스가 노바리스까지 왔다면, 군대는 누가 지휘하고 있어?","source